x"}, "body": "こんにちは、お元気でしたか？また私のOCマルセリーヌを描いてほしい。マルセリーヌは真面目で従順な21歳のお姫様で、余暇は芸術家です。マルセリーヌは美しい秋の風景を描きますが、仕上がりに不満そうです。マルセリーヌの右手首にあるヘーゼル色のアザが見えるように、袖をまくって描いてください。よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/oXHPlc3", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yoshiyanMk_2/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2576597, "client_id": 1416113, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/92a78819/uploads/origins/1d127fe6-577c-4c4c-b051-ca3f2fa2a1c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d22f49c65de920cfcd205a7953da6db3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92a78819/uploads/origins/1d127fe6-577c-4c4c-b051-ca3f2fa2a1c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d22f49c65de920cfcd205a7953da6db3, https://si.imgix.net/92a78819/uploads/origins/1d127fe6-577c-4c4c-b051-ca3f2fa2a1c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b085d6c950665ffba24b08b29972af7b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/92a78819/uploads/origins/1d127fe6-577c-4c4c-b051-ca3f2fa2a1c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1417e4925e19dd324b8ecf4ab3ff11b8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/92a78819/uploads/origins/1d127fe6-577c-4c4c-b051-ca3f2fa2a1c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c69210a6f3845c8c8096bf443c62f90", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/92a78819/uploads/origins/1d127fe6-577c-4c4c-b051-ca3f2fa2a1c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c69210a6f3845c8c8096bf443c62f90, https://si.imgix.net/92a78819/uploads/origins/1d127fe6-577c-4c4c-b051-ca3f2fa2a1c7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=413a67d6dcb86faa2ef784a